{"version":1,"content":"<p>【上水了 🤬】導致所有管理員疲於奔命、全球大量網站要離線避難的 PHP 重大 RCE 漏洞，其洩密者在「深潛多日」後終於「上水」。</p><p>他在 Hacker News 討論區公開道歉，坦承自己在不知情的情況下打破了保密協議（Embargo），並表示自己對打亂官方漏洞揭露時程、加重全球工程師的工作負擔深感歉意，願意承擔全數責任。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T06:21:21.458860+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:10:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T14:18:03.831881+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T06:18:10.022159+00:00","content_hash":"d39ca798caf7c4eb1e7fd713c5b5e354476aaebc65394df9f633cfc049f8c32f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}